{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24491705840519335", "organization": {"id": "2009069909547287", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "27258537980437356"}]}, "id": "1345507774073855"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7891807644259156"}]}, "id": "1260980321504546"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "25642737555351555"}]}, "id": "790680660686165"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "24491705840519335"}]}, "id": "1105814481180458"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "24491705840519335", "release_date": 1766826000, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 13}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28121632817526601"}, "id": "771088165785055"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1795187357, "id": "29653208331035701", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v17", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 10, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "29653309877692213"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "24491705840519335"}, "id": "29653309877692213", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "24491705840519335", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "2874604362736422"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4318713111679712", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["Gef\u00e4ngnis", "Ausbruch", "graben", "Loch", "Simulator"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n# Dig to Escape\n\n**Schnapp dir deine Schaufel und fang an zu graben!**  \n\nDig to Escape ist ein stilisiertes VR-Gef\u00e4ngnisausbruchsspiel, in dem du gr\u00e4bst, \u00fcberlebst und den Maulwurf \u00fcberlistest, um zu entkommen.\n\n{1237325348507167}\n**Grabe nach Upgrades**\n\nBaue wertvolle Mineralien ab und verkaufe sie, um deine Werkzeuge zu verbessern. Bessere Ausr\u00fcstung bedeutet schnelleres Graben, tiefere Tunnel und mehr Fluchtm\u00f6glichkeiten.\n\n\n{25994835953478522}\n**Pass auf den Maulwurf auf**\n\nEin hinterlistiger Dieb hat es auf deine Beute abgesehen. Schnapp ihn, bevor er mit deinen hart erarbeiteten Mineralien entkommt!\n\n\n\n{912532344844187}\n**Werde der Boss unter den Insassen**\n\nK\u00e4mpfe, sch\u00fcchtere ein oder \u00fcberliste andere Insassen. \u00dcbernimm optionale Quests, die deine Flucht unterst\u00fctzen \u2014 oder alles deutlich gef\u00e4hrlicher machen.\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Schnapp dir deine Schaufel und grabe dich in die Freiheit!\n\u00dcberliste die W\u00e4chter, pr\u00fcgle dich mit Mitgefangenen und meistere verr\u00fcckte Quests, w\u00e4hrend du dich durch ein chaotisches VR-Gef\u00e4ngnisausbruch-Abenteuer gr\u00e4bst."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2473381940161169", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["prisi\u00f3n", "escape", "cavar", "agujero", "simulador"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n# Cava para escapar\n\n**\u00a1Toma tu pala y empieza a cavar!**  \n\nCava para escapar es un juego estilizado de fuga de prisi\u00f3n en VR donde cavas, sobrevives y enga\u00f1as al topo para escapar.\n\n{910750908253377}\n**Cava para mejorar**\n\nExtrae minerales valiosos y v\u00e9ndelos para mejorar tus herramientas. Mejor equipo significa cavar m\u00e1s r\u00e1pido, t\u00faneles m\u00e1s profundos y m\u00e1s opciones de escape.\n\n\n{1470513174687425}\n**Cuidado con el topo**\n\nUn ladr\u00f3n astuto va tras tu bot\u00edn. \u00a1Atr\u00e1palo antes de que se lleve tus minerales duramente ganados!\n\n\n{1920504108556875}\n**Convi\u00e9rtete en el jefe de los presos**\n\nPelea, intimida o enga\u00f1a a otros presos. Realiza misiones opcionales que pueden ayudarte a escapar \u2014 o hacer las cosas mucho m\u00e1s peligrosas.\n\n\n", "short_description": "\u00a1Toma tu pala y cava tu camino hacia la libertad! Enga\u00f1a a los guardias, pelea con los reclusos y enfr\u00e9ntate a misiones disparatadas mientras excavas t\u00faneles en esta ca\u00f3tica aventura de fuga de prisi\u00f3n en VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2029822087658461", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["prison", "\u00e9vasion", "creuser", "trou", "simulateur"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n# Creusez pour vous \u00e9chapper\n\n**Prenez votre pelle et commencez \u00e0 creuser !**  \n\nDig to Escape est un jeu VR d\u2019\u00e9vasion de prison stylis\u00e9 o\u00f9 vous creusez, survivez et d\u00e9jouez la taupe pour vous \u00e9chapper.\n\n{1446378773935189}\n**Creusez pour des am\u00e9liorations**\n\nExtrayez des min\u00e9raux pr\u00e9cieux et vendez-les pour am\u00e9liorer vos outils. Un meilleur \u00e9quipement signifie un creusage plus rapide, des tunnels plus profonds et davantage d\u2019options d\u2019\u00e9vasion.\n\n\n{4352204881683278}\n**Attention \u00e0 la taupe**\n\nUn voleur sournois est apr\u00e8s votre butin. Attrapez-le avant qu\u2019il ne s\u2019enfuie avec vos min\u00e9raux durement gagn\u00e9s !\n\n\n\n{1733297934339557}\n**Devenez le chef des d\u00e9tenus**\n\nBagarrez-vous, intimidez ou d\u00e9jouez les autres d\u00e9tenus. Accomplissez des qu\u00eates optionnelles qui peuvent aider votre \u00e9vasion \u2014 ou rendre les choses bien plus dangereuses.\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Prenez votre pelle et creusez votre chemin vers la libert\u00e9 !\nD\u00e9jouez les gardiens, bagarrez-vous avec les d\u00e9tenus et relevez des qu\u00eates d\u00e9jant\u00e9es en creusant votre \u00e9vasion \u00e0 travers une aventure chaotique d\u2019\u00e9vasion de prison en VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1859248228421163", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["\uac10\uc625", "\ud0c8\ucd9c", "\ud30c\ub2e4", "\uad6c\uba4d", "\uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\ud130"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n# \ud0c8\ucd9c\uc744 \ud5a5\ud574 \ud30c\ub77c\n\n**\uc0bd\uc744 \ub4e4\uace0 \ub545\uc744 \ud30c\uae30 \uc2dc\uc791\ud558\ub77c!**  \n\n\ud0c8\ucd9c\uc744 \ud5a5\ud574 \ud30c\ub77c\ub294 \uc2a4\ud0c0\uc77c\ub9ac\uc2dc\ud55c VR \ud0c8\uc625 \uac8c\uc784\uc73c\ub85c, \ub545\uc744 \ud30c\uace0, \uc0dd\uc874\ud558\uba70, \ub450\ub354\uc9c0\ub97c \uc18d\uc5ec \ud0c8\ucd9c\ud558\ub294 \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n{2252759775132353}\n**\uc5c5\uadf8\ub808\uc774\ub4dc\ub97c \uc704\ud574 \ud30c\ub77c**\n\n\uadc0\uc911\ud55c \uad11\ubb3c\uc744 \ucc44\uad74\ud558\uace0 \ud310\ub9e4\ud558\uc5ec \ub3c4\uad6c\ub97c \uc5c5\uadf8\ub808\uc774\ub4dc\ud558\uc138\uc694. \ub354 \uc88b\uc740 \uc7a5\ube44\ub294 \ub354 \ube60\ub978 \uad74\ucc29, \ub354 \uae4a\uc740 \ud130\ub110, \uadf8\ub9ac\uace0 \ub354 \ub9ce\uc740 \ud0c8\ucd9c \uc635\uc158\uc744 \uc81c\uacf5\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\n{1280652240597785}\n**\ub450\ub354\uc9c0\ub97c \uc870\uc2ec\ud558\ub77c**\n\n\uad50\ud65c\ud55c \ub3c4\ub451\uc774 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uc804\ub9ac\ud488\uc744 \ub178\ub9bd\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5f4\uc2ec\ud788 \ubaa8\uc740 \uad11\ubb3c\uc744 \ud6d4\uce58\uae30 \uc804\uc5d0 \uc7a1\uc73c\uc138\uc694!\n\n\n{1451714646670473}\n**\uc8c4\uc218 \ubcf4\uc2a4\uac00 \ub418\uc5b4\ub77c**\n\n\ub2e4\ub978 \uc8c4\uc218\ub4e4\uacfc \uc2f8\uc6b0\uace0, \uc704\ud611\ud558\uace0, \ub610\ub294 \uc18d\uc774\uc138\uc694. \uc120\ud0dd \ud018\uc2a4\ud2b8\ub97c \uc218\ud589\ud558\uc5ec \ud0c8\ucd9c\uc744 \ub3d5\uac70\ub098, \uc0c1\ud669\uc744 \ud6e8\uc52c \ub354 \uc704\ud5d8\ud558\uac8c \ub9cc\ub4e4 \uc218\ub3c4 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\n", "short_description": "\uc0bd\uc744 \ub4e4\uace0 \uc790\uc720\ub97c \ud5a5\ud574 \ub545\uc744 \ud30c\ub77c! \uacbd\ube44\ubcd1\uc744 \uc18d\uc774\uace0, \uc8c4\uc218\ub4e4\uacfc \uc2f8\uc6b0\uba70, \uc5c9\ub6b1\ud55c \ud018\uc2a4\ud2b8\ub97c \uc218\ud589\ud558\uba70 \ud63c\ub3c8\uc758 VR \ud0c8\uc625 \ubaa8\ud5d8\uc744 \ub6ab\uace0 \ub098\uac00\ub77c."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1775667171228668", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["\u76d1\u72f1", "\u9003\u8131", "\u6316", "\u6d1e", "\u6a21\u62df\u5668"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n# \u6316\u51fa\u9003\u751f\u8def\n\n**\u62ff\u8d77\u4f60\u7684\u94f2\u5b50\uff0c\u5f00\u59cb\u6316\u6398\u5427\uff01**  \n\n\u6316\u51fa\u9003\u751f\u8def\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u98ce\u683c\u5316\u7684VR\u8d8a\u72f1\u6e38\u620f\uff0c\u5728\u8fd9\u91cc\u4f60\u9700\u8981\u6316\u6398\u3001\u751f\u5b58\uff0c\u5e76\u667a\u80dc\u201c\u9f39\u9f20\u201d\u4ee5\u9003\u8131\u3002\n\n{1228813532185699}\n**\u6316\u6398\u4ee5\u5347\u7ea7**\n\n\u5f00\u91c7\u73cd\u8d35\u77ff\u7269\u5e76\u51fa\u552e\uff0c\u7528\u4e8e\u5347\u7ea7\u4f60\u7684\u5de5\u5177\u3002\u66f4\u597d\u7684\u88c5\u5907\u610f\u5473\u7740\u66f4\u5feb\u7684\u6316\u6398\u3001\u66f4\u6df1\u7684\u96a7\u9053\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u66f4\u591a\u7684\u9003\u8131\u9009\u9879\u3002\n\n\n{961778742955503}\n**\u5c0f\u5fc3\u201c\u9f39\u9f20\u201d**\n\n\u72e1\u733e\u7684\u5c0f\u5077\u76ef\u4e0a\u4e86\u4f60\u7684\u6218\u5229\u54c1\u3002\u5728\u4ed6\u5077\u8d70\u4f60\u8f9b\u82e6\u83b7\u5f97\u7684\u77ff\u7269\u4e4b\u524d\u6293\u4f4f\u4ed6\uff01\n\n\n{2085378488911800}\n**\u6210\u4e3a\u56da\u72af\u8001\u5927**\n\n\u4e0e\u5176\u4ed6\u56da\u72af\u6253\u6597\u3001\u5a01\u80c1\u6216\u667a\u80dc\u4ed6\u4eec\u3002\u63a5\u53d7\u53ef\u9009\u4efb\u52a1\uff0c\u8fd9\u4e9b\u4efb\u52a1\u53ef\u4ee5\u5e2e\u52a9\u4f60\u9003\u8131\u2014\u2014\u4e5f\u53ef\u80fd\u8ba9\u4e8b\u60c5\u53d8\u5f97\u66f4\u52a0\u5371\u9669\u3002\n\n\n", "short_description": "\u62ff\u8d77\u4f60\u7684\u94f2\u5b50\uff0c\u6316\u51fa\u901a\u5f80\u81ea\u7531\u7684\u9053\u8def\uff01\u667a\u80dc\u8b66\u536b\uff0c\u4e0e\u56da\u72af\u6df7\u6218\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u6df7\u4e71\u7684VR\u8d8a\u72f1\u5192\u9669\u4e2d\u5b8c\u6210\u5404\u79cd\u75af\u72c2\u4efb\u52a1\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "layered_icon_composited.png", "id": "3593136130861053", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LAYERED_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842208_3593136134194386_1845996538889830956_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QaeGKQ4XmlwQ7kNvwGUWpVO&_nc_oc=AdoULDpTt7PNaNCUM2_pQVx9B_YtR3psWfl2dRv4Zgd-DSn-DxYNMIePLoGTDkR4OOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTH_OB0qhgB3mfdOij_fOj1cBsk9cH-8bJ62JkBnsLAjA&oe=6B0C519F"}, {"file_name": "Foreground icon.png", "id": "2139735360009344", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_FOREGROUND_512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842294_2139735363342677_1847980002138253706_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NAqZeFeluPcQ7kNvwGijo-d&_nc_oc=AdrukMl1r7Uc9sixiva47RcQKAnjdR_KMcGMgNZwkGWLYTjo_znhBr0s7aQP7DM4rxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT5Er1VTJT10R8Y4nC3ntyQPTDrTc5YsNKbkzM1duj4fw&oe=6B0C6787"}, {"file_name": "Square.png", "id": "2058371621548682", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842234_2058371624882015_6102399954929572228_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A5okqyTzjrAQ7kNvwFN5AJF&_nc_oc=AdrnrZHjZPoE8ttoMLQmqOBI8fnX0ZN_cYLaFYTs7hwAiQ3V43ZuqYpM9eFqGJlbt5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQBjj3CakHetzXhvV1tidYvhtq3MTXczH_YT9-z1bku3A&oe=6B0C5E07"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1905415133955420", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842277_1905415137288753_5283715331590834671_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RXndVv8mIecQ7kNvwHV_Ofu&_nc_oc=AdpNcw6oFlw0ZfR40sKMIwhLUYwJ0w2zulnYSXfWbqKn1O8mdNyu